```python
def ledger_pairs(doc):
    pairs=set()
    for row in doc['implication_ledger']['one_way_entailments']:
        if str(row.get('relation'))=='entails':
            a,b=canon(row.get('from')),canon(row.get('to'))
            if a and b: pairs.add((a,b))
    return pairs
```

